# Zombie: civil servant / security guard (cap, badge). Side view, faces right, 24x32 like the protagonist.
# Grey-green skin and grime instead of blood (no gore, docs/decisions.md D9).
# idle x2, shambling walk x4 (one foot drags), lunge, stun (shields its
# eyes from the flashlight).
@palette ../palette/night-school.pal
@size 24 32
@output ../characters/zombie_guard.png
@preview ../previews/zombie_guard_x6.png 6
@columns 4

